<hr data-start=3D"4454" data-end=3D"4457">
<h3 data-start=3D"4459" data-end=3D"4489">=F0=9F=A7=B5 D=C3=A9tail des phil=
osophies</h3>
<h4 data-start=3D"4491" data-end=3D"4522">=F0=9F=94=A7 Git : la bo=C3=AEte =
=C3=A0 outils</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"4523" data-end=3D"4823">
<li data-start=3D"4523" data-end=3D"4580">
<p data-start=3D"4525" data-end=3D"4580">Con=C3=A7u par <strong data-start=
=3D"4535" data-end=3D"4553">Linus Torvalds</strong> pour g=C3=A9rer le noya=
u Linux.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4581" data-end=3D"4608">
<p data-start=3D"4583" data-end=3D"4608">Puissant mais bas niveau.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4609" data-end=3D"4693">
<p data-start=3D"4611" data-end=3D"4693">Tr=C3=A8s flexible : vous pouvez t=
out faire=E2=80=A6 mais vous devez savoir ce que vous faites.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4694" data-end=3D"4760">
<p data-start=3D"4696" data-end=3D"4760">Bas=C3=A9 sur des <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"4709" data-end=3D"4722">snapshots</strong> (copies de l=E2=80=99=C3=
=A9tat complet du projet).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4761" data-end=3D"4823">
<p data-start=3D"4763" data-end=3D"4823">Id=C3=A9al pour les projets comple=
xes, collaboratifs, distribu=C3=A9s.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start=3D"4825" data-end=3D"4864">=F0=9F=93=9A SVN : la simplicit=
=C3=A9 centralis=C3=A9e</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"4865" data-end=3D"5097">
<li data-start=3D"4865" data-end=3D"4922">
<p data-start=3D"4867" data-end=3D"4922">Mod=C3=A8le client/serveur : tout =
d=C3=A9pend du serveur central.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4923" data-end=3D"4991">
<p data-start=3D"4925" data-end=3D"4991">Fonctionne bien pour des =C3=A9qui=
pes structur=C3=A9es avec un d=C3=A9p=C3=B4t unique.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4992" data-end=3D"5034">
<p data-start=3D"4994" data-end=3D"5034">Moins souple pour travailler en of=
fline.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5035" data-end=3D"5097">
<p data-start=3D"5037" data-end=3D"5097">S=E2=80=99int=C3=A8gre bien dans d=
es environnements anciens ou contr=C3=B4l=C3=A9s.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start=3D"5099" data-end=3D"5133">=F0=9F=92=BC Mercurial : entre le=
s deux</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"5134" data-end=3D"5357">
<li data-start=3D"5134" data-end=3D"5185">
<p data-start=3D"5136" data-end=3D"5185">Distribu=C3=A9 comme Git, mais plu=
s simple =C3=A0 utiliser.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5186" data-end=3D"5223">
<p data-start=3D"5188" data-end=3D"5223">Commandes coh=C3=A9rentes et intui=
tives.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5224" data-end=3D"5295">
<p data-start=3D"5226" data-end=3D"5295">Moins populaire, donc moins d=E2=
=80=99outils, moins de support communautaire.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5296" data-end=3D"5357">
<p data-start=3D"5298" data-end=3D"5357">Utilis=C3=A9 longtemps par Bitbuck=
et (avant 2020), Mozilla, etc.</p>
</li>
</ul>
