<li data-start=3D"5461" data-end=3D"5523">
<p data-start=3D"5463" data-end=3D"5523">Si deux objets ont le m=C3=AAme co=
ntenu, ils auront le m=C3=AAme SHA-1</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5524" data-end=3D"5596">
<p data-start=3D"5526" data-end=3D"5596">Si un fichier change d=E2=80=99un =
seul caract=C3=A8re, le SHA-1 change compl=C3=A8tement</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5597" data-end=3D"5663">
<p data-start=3D"5599" data-end=3D"5663">Cela <strong data-start=3D"5604" d=
ata-end=3D"5628">garantit l=E2=80=99int=C3=A9grit=C3=A9</strong> et <strong=
 data-start=3D"5632" data-end=3D"5645">l=E2=80=99unicit=C3=A9</strong> de c=
haque version</p>
</li>
</ul>
