<hr data-start=3D"1567" data-end=3D"1570">
<h2 data-start=3D"1572" data-end=3D"1625">=F0=9F=A7=AA 2. Avantages et inco=
nv=C3=A9nients de chaque m=C3=A9thode</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"1627" data-end=3D"1639">=F0=9F=94=90 HTTPS</h3>
<h4 data-start=3D"1641" data-end=3D"1659">=E2=9C=85 Avantages :</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"1660" data-end=3D"1857">
<li data-start=3D"1660" data-end=3D"1728">
<p data-start=3D"1662" data-end=3D"1728">Fonctionne dans presque tous les e=
nvironnements (proxy, firewall).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1729" data-end=3D"1790">
<p data-start=3D"1731" data-end=3D"1790">Facile =C3=A0 utiliser avec des to=
kens d=E2=80=99acc=C3=A8s personnels (PAT).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1791" data-end=3D"1857">
<p data-start=3D"1793" data-end=3D"1857">Int=C3=A9gr=C3=A9 dans les interfa=
ces graphiques (GitHub Desktop, VSCode).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start=3D"1859" data-end=3D"1881">=E2=9D=8C Inconv=C3=A9nients :</h=
