=C3=A9).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1987" data-end=3D"2038">
<p data-start=3D"1989" data-end=3D"2038">Moins adapt=C3=A9 =C3=A0 l=E2=80=
=99automatisation (scripts, CI/CD).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"2040" data-end=3D"2050">=F0=9F=94=91 SSH</h3>
<h4 data-start=3D"2052" data-end=3D"2070">=E2=9C=85 Avantages :</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"2071" data-end=3D"2250">
<li data-start=3D"2071" data-end=3D"2128">
<p data-start=3D"2073" data-end=3D"2128">Authentification sans mot de passe=
 apr=C3=A8s configuration.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2129" data-end=3D"2190">
<p data-start=3D"2131" data-end=3D"2190">Plus rapide dans les workflows pro=
 (push/pull sans prompt).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2191" data-end=3D"2250">
