<p data-start=3D"2830" data-end=3D"2859"><code data-start=3D"2830" data-end=
=3D"2842">post-merge</code> : apr=C3=A8s un merge</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2860" data-end=3D"2888">
<p data-start=3D"2862" data-end=3D"2888"><code data-start=3D"2862" data-end=
=3D"2872">pre-push</code> : avant un push</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"2890" data-end=3D"3010">Par d=C3=A9faut, ces scripts sont =
d=C3=A9sactiv=C3=A9s (extension <code data-start=3D"2941" data-end=3D"2950"=
>.sample</code>). Pour les activer, renommez-les et rendez-les ex=C3=A9cuta=
bles.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"3012" data-end=3D"3015">
<h3 data-start=3D"3017" data-end=3D"3036">=F0=9F=93=81 <code data-start=3D"=
3024" data-end=3D"3036">.git/info/</code></h3>
<p data-start=3D"3037" data-end=3D"3089">Contient des infos compl=C3=A9ment=
aires locales au d=C3=A9p=C3=B4t.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3091" data-end=3D"3162">
<li data-start=3D"3091" data-end=3D"3162">
<p data-start=3D"3093" data-end=3D"3162"><code data-start=3D"3093" data-end=
=3D"3102">exclude</code> : fonctionne comme un <code data-start=3D"3125" da=
ta-end=3D"3137">.gitignore</code> <strong data-start=3D"3138" data-end=3D"3=
147">local</strong> et temporaire.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"3164" data-end=3D"3167">
<h3 data-start=3D"3169" data-end=3D"3191">=F0=9F=93=81 <code data-start=3D"=
3176" data-end=3D"3191">.git/objects/</code></h3>
<p data-start=3D"3192" data-end=3D"3273">Le <strong data-start=3D"3195" dat=
a-end=3D"3210">c=C5=93ur de Git</strong> : la base de donn=C3=A9es des obje=
ts (blobs, trees, commits, tags).</p>
<p data-start=3D"3275" data-end=3D"3349">Chaque objet Git est un <strong da=
ta-start=3D"3299" data-end=3D"3320">fichier compress=C3=A9</strong>, identi=
fi=C3=A9 par un <strong data-start=3D"3339" data-end=3D"3348">SHA-1</strong=
>.</p>
<p data-start=3D"3351" data-end=3D"3360">Exemple :</p>
