<p data-start=3D"3412" data-end=3D"3460">Git stocke les objets par <strong =
data-start=3D"3438" data-end=3D"3449">pr=C3=A9fixe</strong> de SHA-1 :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3461" data-end=3D"3527">
<li data-start=3D"3461" data-end=3D"3527">
<p data-start=3D"3463" data-end=3D"3527"><code data-start=3D"3463" data-end=
=3D"3477">2c/7c22a1...</code> =E2=86=92 <code data-start=3D"3480" data-end=
=3D"3484">2c</code> est le dossier, <code data-start=3D"3501" data-end=3D"3=
512">7c22a1...</code> est le fichier</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"3529" data-end=3D"3549">Types d=E2=80=99objets Git :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3550" data-end=3D"3695">
<li data-start=3D"3550" data-end=3D"3583">
<p data-start=3D"3552" data-end=3D"3583"><strong data-start=3D"3552" data-e=
nd=3D"3560">Blob</strong> : contenu d=E2=80=99un fichier</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3584" data-end=3D"3621">
<p data-start=3D"3586" data-end=3D"3621"><strong data-start=3D"3586" data-e=
nd=3D"3594">Tree</strong> : arborescence de fichiers</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3622" data-end=3D"3658">
<p data-start=3D"3624" data-end=3D"3658"><strong data-start=3D"3624" data-e=
nd=3D"3634">Commit</strong> : point de l=E2=80=99historique</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3659" data-end=3D"3695">
<p data-start=3D"3661" data-end=3D"3695"><strong data-start=3D"3661" data-e=
nd=3D"3668">Tag</strong> : annotation sur un commit</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"3697" data-end=3D"3767">=F0=9F=A7=A0 Git <strong data-star=
t=3D"3704" data-end=3D"3731">ne stocke pas des diffs</strong>, mais des <st=
rong data-start=3D"3742" data-end=3D"3766">snapshots compress=C3=A9s</stron=
g>.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"3769" data-end=3D"3772">
<h3 data-start=3D"3774" data-end=3D"3801">=F0=9F=93=81 <code data-start=3D"=
3781" data-end=3D"3801">.git/objects/pack/</code></h3>
<p data-start=3D"3802" data-end=3D"3944">Lorsque Git effectue un <strong da=
ta-start=3D"3826" data-end=3D"3838"><code data-start=3D"3828" data-end=3D"3=
836">git gc</code></strong> (garbage collection), il compresse les objets d=
ans des <strong data-start=3D"3894" data-end=3D"3911">fichiers pack</strong=
>, pour optimiser l=E2=80=99espace disque.</p>
