<hr data-start=3D"4083" data-end=3D"4086">
<h3 data-start=3D"4088" data-end=3D"4107">=F0=9F=93=81 <code data-start=3D"=
4095" data-end=3D"4107">.git/refs/</code></h3>
<p data-start=3D"4109" data-end=3D"4138">Contient les <strong data-start=3D=
"4122" data-end=3D"4136">r=C3=A9f=C3=A9rences</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4139" data-end=3D"4300">
<li data-start=3D"4139" data-end=3D"4194">
<p data-start=3D"4141" data-end=3D"4194"><code data-start=3D"4141" data-end=
=3D"4149">heads/</code> : les branches locales (<code data-start=3D"4174" d=
ata-end=3D"4180">main</code>, <code data-start=3D"4182" data-end=3D"4187">d=
ev</code>, etc.)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4195" data-end=3D"4254">
<p data-start=3D"4197" data-end=3D"4254"><code data-start=3D"4197" data-end=
=3D"4207">remotes/</code> : les branches distantes (<code data-start=3D"423=
4" data-end=3D"4247">origin/main</code>, etc.)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4255" data-end=3D"4300">
<p data-start=3D"4257" data-end=3D"4300"><code data-start=3D"4257" data-end=
=3D"4264">tags/</code> : les tags (releases, v1.0.0, etc.)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"4302" data-end=3D"4356">Chaque fichier contient le <strong=
 data-start=3D"4329" data-end=3D"4338">SHA-1</strong> du commit point=C3=A9=
.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"4358" data-end=3D"4361">
<h3 data-start=3D"4363" data-end=3D"4382">=F0=9F=93=81 <code data-start=3D"=
4370" data-end=3D"4382">.git/logs/</code></h3>
<p data-start=3D"4384" data-end=3D"4446">Contient les <strong data-start=3D=
"4397" data-end=3D"4420">journaux d=E2=80=99activit=C3=A9</strong> de HEAD =
et des branches :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4448" data-end=3D"4563">
<li data-start=3D"4448" data-end=3D"4499">
<p data-start=3D"4450" data-end=3D"4499"><code data-start=3D"4450" data-end=
=3D"4466">.git/logs/HEAD</code> : historique des mouvements HEAD</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4500" data-end=3D"4563">
<p data-start=3D"4502" data-end=3D"4563"><code data-start=3D"4502" data-end=
=3D"4529">.git/logs/refs/heads/main</code> : historique de la branche <code=
 data-start=3D"4557" data-end=3D"4563">main</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"4565" data-end=3D"4597">=F0=9F=A7=A0 Ces logs sont utilis=
=C3=A9s pour :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4598" data-end=3D"4714">
<li data-start=3D"4598" data-end=3D"4646">
<p data-start=3D"4600" data-end=3D"4646"><code data-start=3D"4600" data-end=
=3D"4612">git reflog</code> : retrouver des commits supprim=C3=A9s</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4647" data-end=3D"4714">
<p data-start=3D"4649" data-end=3D"4714">Sauver des situations critiques ap=
r=C3=A8s des <code data-start=3D"4691" data-end=3D"4698">reset</code>, <cod=
e data-start=3D"4700" data-end=3D"4708">rebase</code>, etc.</p>
</li>
</ul>
