<h2 data-start=3D"6452" data-end=3D"6468">=F0=9F=8E=93 Conclusion</h2>
<p data-start=3D"6470" data-end=3D"6518">Comprendre l=E2=80=99arborescence =
de <code data-start=3D"6499" data-end=3D"6506">.git/</code> permet de :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6519" data-end=3D"6686">
<li data-start=3D"6519" data-end=3D"6547">
<p data-start=3D"6521" data-end=3D"6547">D=C3=A9bugger Git en profondeur</p=
>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6548" data-end=3D"6596">
