</li>
<li data-start=3D"6629" data-end=3D"6686">
<p data-start=3D"6631" data-end=3D"6686">Mieux comprendre les m=C3=A9canism=
es internes du versionnage</p>
</li>
</ul>
<blockquote data-start=3D"6688" data-end=3D"6851">
<p data-start=3D"6690" data-end=3D"6851">Git est bien plus qu=E2=80=99une s=
