<hr data-start=3D"6828" data-end=3D"6831">
<h2 data-start=3D"6833" data-end=3D"6848">=E2=9C=85 Conclusion</h2>
<p data-start=3D"6850" data-end=3D"6976">Annuler dans Git est un <strong da=
ta-start=3D"6874" data-end=3D"6888">art subtil</strong>. Git vous donne la =
puissance d'annuler =C3=A0 <strong data-start=3D"6930" data-end=3D"6952">di=
ff=C3=A9rents niveaux</strong>, en toute flexibilit=C3=A9 :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6978" data-end=3D"7131">
<li data-start=3D"6978" data-end=3D"7021">
<p data-start=3D"6980" data-end=3D"7021"><code data-start=3D"6980" data-end=
=3D"6993">git restore</code> : <strong data-start=3D"6996" data-end=3D"7021=
">modifications locales</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7022" data-end=3D"7063">
<p data-start=3D"7024" data-end=3D"7063"><code data-start=3D"7024" data-end=
=3D"7035">git reset</code> : <strong data-start=3D"7038" data-end=3D"7063">=
staging et historique</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7064" data-end=3D"7131">
<p data-start=3D"7066" data-end=3D"7131"><code data-start=3D"7066" data-end=
=3D"7080">git checkout</code> : <strong data-start=3D"7083" data-end=3D"709=
7">navigation</strong> dans l=E2=80=99historique ou les branches</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"7133" data-end=3D"7168">Comprendre ces outils vous permet =
:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"7170" data-end=3D"7306">
<li data-start=3D"7170" data-end=3D"7199">
<p data-start=3D"7172" data-end=3D"7199">D=E2=80=99exp=C3=A9rimenter sans c=
rainte</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7200" data-end=3D"7247">
<p data-start=3D"7202" data-end=3D"7247">De corriger des erreurs sans perte=
 de travail</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7248" data-end=3D"7306">
<p data-start=3D"7250" data-end=3D"7306">D=E2=80=99avoir un contr=C3=B4le t=
otal sur l=E2=80=99=C3=A9volution de vos projets</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"7308" data-end=3D"7351">Souhaitez-vous maintenant un tutor=
