<p data-start=3D"7355" data-end=3D"7419"><code data-start=3D"7355" data-end=
=3D"7366">git stash</code> pour mettre de c=C3=B4t=C3=A9 temporairement des=
 changements ?</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7420" data-end=3D"7486">
