<li data-start=3D"3643" data-end=3D"3772">
<p data-start=3D"3646" data-end=3D"3660">V=C3=A9rifiez que :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3664" data-end=3D"3772">
<li data-start=3D"3664" data-end=3D"3727">
<p data-start=3D"3666" data-end=3D"3727"><code data-start=3D"3666" data-end=
=3D"3672">base</code> est la branche du <strong data-start=3D"3691" data-en=
d=3D"3710">projet original</strong> (souvent <code data-start=3D"3720" data=
-end=3D"3726">main</code>)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3731" data-end=3D"3772">
<p data-start=3D"3733" data-end=3D"3772"><code data-start=3D"3733" data-end=
=3D"3742">compare</code> est <strong data-start=3D"3747" data-end=3D"3764">=
votre branche</strong> du fork</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3773" data-end=3D"3813">
<p data-start=3D"3776" data-end=3D"3813">Cliquez sur <strong data-start=3D"=
3788" data-end=3D"3813">"Create pull request"</strong></p>
</li>
</ol>
