<h3 data-start=3D"1821" data-end=3D"1851">2.2 Cr=C3=A9er la PR sur GitHub</=
h3>
<ul data-start=3D"1853" data-end=3D"2197">
<li data-start=3D"1853" data-end=3D"1880">
<p data-start=3D"1855" data-end=3D"1880">Allez sur le d=C3=A9p=C3=B4t GitHu=
b</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1881" data-end=3D"1980">
<p data-start=3D"1883" data-end=3D"1980">GitHub d=C3=A9tecte souvent automa=
tiquement la branche nouvellement pouss=C3=A9e et propose de cr=C3=A9er une=
 PR</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1981" data-end=3D"2042">
<p data-start=3D"1983" data-end=3D"2042">Sinon, cliquez sur <strong data-st=
art=3D"2002" data-end=3D"2019">Pull Requests</strong> &gt; <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"2022" data-end=3D"2042">New Pull Request</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2043" data-end=3D"2127">
<p data-start=3D"2045" data-end=3D"2127">Choisissez la branche source (<cod=
e data-start=3D"2075" data-end=3D"2088">feature/xyz</code>) et la branche c=
ible (<code data-start=3D"2111" data-end=3D"2117">main</code> ou autre)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2128" data-end=3D"2179">
<p data-start=3D"2130" data-end=3D"2179">Donnez un titre clair et une descr=
iption compl=C3=A8te</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2180" data-end=3D"2197">
<p data-start=3D"2182" data-end=3D"2197">Soumettez la PR</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"2199" data-end=3D"2202">
<h2 data-start=3D"2204" data-end=3D"2248">=F0=9F=94=8D 3. Contenu et revue =
d=E2=80=99une Pull Request</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"2250" data-end=3D"2284">3.1 Visualiser les diff=C3=A9renc=
es</h3>
<p data-start=3D"2286" data-end=3D"2346">La PR affiche tous les commits et =
modifications de fichiers.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"2348" data-end=3D"2384">3.2 Commentaires ligne par ligne<=
/h3>
<p data-start=3D"2386" data-end=3D"2483">Vous ou les reviewers pouvez comme=
nter des lignes sp=C3=A9cifiques pour discuter d=E2=80=99un morceau de code=
.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"2485" data-end=3D"2514">3.3 Discussions g=C3=A9n=C3=A9ral=
es</h3>
<p data-start=3D"2516" data-end=3D"2592">On peut discuter dans l=E2=80=99on=
glet Conversation avec commentaires plus g=C3=A9n=C3=A9raux.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"2594" data-end=3D"2617">3.4 Statut de la PR</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"2619" data-end=3D"2750">
<li data-start=3D"2619" data-end=3D"2664">
<p data-start=3D"2621" data-end=3D"2664"><strong data-start=3D"2621" data-e=
nd=3D"2629">Open</strong> : PR en attente de revue ou fusion</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2665" data-end=3D"2713">
<p data-start=3D"2667" data-end=3D"2713"><strong data-start=3D"2667" data-e=
nd=3D"2677">Merged</strong> : PR int=C3=A9gr=C3=A9e dans la branche cible</=
p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2714" data-end=3D"2750">
<p data-start=3D"2716" data-end=3D"2750"><strong data-start=3D"2716" data-e=
nd=3D"2726">Closed</strong> : PR ferm=C3=A9e sans fusion</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"2752" data-end=3D"2755">
<h2 data-start=3D"2757" data-end=3D"2785">=F0=9F=A7=B9 4. Revue et validati=
on</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"2787" data-end=3D"2815">4.1 Requ=C3=A9rir des reviews</h3=
>
<p data-start=3D"2817" data-end=3D"2919">Dans les param=C3=A8tres du d=C3=
=A9p=C3=B4t, vous pouvez demander une ou plusieurs reviews obligatoires ava=
nt fusion.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"2921" data-end=3D"2962">4.2 Validation via checks automat=
is=C3=A9s</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"2964" data-end=3D"3152">
<li data-start=3D"2964" data-end=3D"3048">
<p data-start=3D"2966" data-end=3D"3048">Int=C3=A9gration continue (CI) d=
=C3=A9clench=C3=A9e automatiquement pour ex=C3=A9cuter tests, linters=E2=80=
=A6</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3049" data-end=3D"3094">
<p data-start=3D"3051" data-end=3D"3094">Le statut des checks est visible d=
ans la PR</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3095" data-end=3D"3152">
<p data-start=3D"3097" data-end=3D"3152">La fusion peut =C3=AAtre bloqu=C3=
=A9e si certains checks =C3=A9chouent</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"3154" data-end=3D"3188">4.3 Apporter des modifications</h=
3>
<p data-start=3D"3190" data-end=3D"3226">Si la PR n=C3=A9cessite des change=
ments :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3228" data-end=3D"3396">
<li data-start=3D"3228" data-end=3D"3275">
<p data-start=3D"3230" data-end=3D"3275">Apportez-les localement sur la bra=
nche source</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3276" data-end=3D"3338">
