<p data-start=3D"3854" data-end=3D"3901">La PR sera mise =C3=A0 jour, pr=C3=
=AAte =C3=A0 =C3=AAtre fusionn=C3=A9e.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"3903" data-end=3D"3906">
<h2 data-start=3D"3908" data-end=3D"3951">=E2=9A=99=EF=B8=8F 6. Options ava=
nc=C3=A9es des Pull Requests</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"3953" data-end=3D"3980">6.1 Draft Pull Requests</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3982" data-end=3D"4103">
<li data-start=3D"3982" data-end=3D"4038">
<p data-start=3D"3984" data-end=3D"4038">Permettent de signaler que la PR e=
st encore en travail</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4039" data-end=3D"4103">
<p data-start=3D"4041" data-end=3D"4103">Ne peuvent pas =C3=AAtre fusionn=
=C3=A9es tant que non "ready for review"</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"4105" data-end=3D"4138">6.2 Templates de Pull Request</h3=
>
<ul data-start=3D"4140" data-end=3D"4329">
<li data-start=3D"4140" data-end=3D"4177">
<p data-start=3D"4142" data-end=3D"4177">Pour standardiser le contenu des P=
R</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4178" data-end=3D"4226">
<p data-start=3D"4180" data-end=3D"4226">Plac=C3=A9s dans <code data-start=
=3D"4192" data-end=3D"4226">.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4227" data-end=3D"4329">
<p data-start=3D"4229" data-end=3D"4329">Aide =C3=A0 guider les contributeu=
rs sur ce qu=E2=80=99ils doivent fournir (description, checklist, screensho=
ts=E2=80=A6)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"4331" data-end=3D"4362">6.3 Protection des branches</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"4364" data-end=3D"4523">
<li data-start=3D"4364" data-end=3D"4413">
<p data-start=3D"4366" data-end=3D"4413">Configuration pour prot=C3=A9ger <=
code data-start=3D"4394" data-end=3D"4400">main</code> ou <code data-start=
=3D"4404" data-end=3D"4413">develop</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4414" data-end=3D"4466">
<p data-start=3D"4416" data-end=3D"4466">Exiger la revue, checks pass=C3=A9=
s, pas de push direct</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4467" data-end=3D"4523">
<p data-start=3D"4469" data-end=3D"4523">Forcer l=E2=80=99utilisation des P=
R pour modifier ces branches</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"4525" data-end=3D"4528">
<h2 data-start=3D"4530" data-end=3D"4565">=F0=9F=94=84 7. Fusionner une Pul=
l Request</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"4567" data-end=3D"4604">7.1 M=C3=A9thodes de fusion sur G=
itHub</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"4606" data-end=3D"4806">
<li data-start=3D"4606" data-end=3D"4672">
<p data-start=3D"4608" data-end=3D"4672"><strong data-start=3D"4608" data-e=
nd=3D"4624">Merge commit</strong> : cr=C3=A9e un commit de fusion (historiq=
ue complet)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4673" data-end=3D"4733">
<p data-start=3D"4675" data-end=3D"4733"><strong data-start=3D"4675" data-e=
nd=3D"4695">Squash and merge</strong> : combine tous les commits en un seul=
</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4734" data-end=3D"4806">
<p data-start=3D"4736" data-end=3D"4806"><strong data-start=3D"4736" data-e=
nd=3D"4756">Rebase and merge</strong> : rebase la branche source avant fusi=
on, lin=C3=A9aire</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"4808" data-end=3D"4843">7.2 Choisir une m=C3=A9thode adap=
t=C3=A9e</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"4845" data-end=3D"4977">
<li data-start=3D"4845" data-end=3D"4895">
<p data-start=3D"4847" data-end=3D"4895">Le merge commit pour garder l=E2=
=80=99historique complet</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4896" data-end=3D"4938">
<p data-start=3D"4898" data-end=3D"4938">Le squash pour un historique plus =
propre</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4939" data-end=3D"4977">
<p data-start=3D"4941" data-end=3D"4977">Le rebase pour une histoire lin=C3=
=A9aire</p>
</li>
</ul>
