D =C3=A0 chaque PR</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5075" data-end=3D"5133">
<p data-start=3D"5077" data-end=3D"5133">Automatiser la v=C3=A9rification d=
u code, tests, d=C3=A9ploiements</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5134" data-end=3D"5206">
<p data-start=3D"5136" data-end=3D"5206">Ajouter des bots pour g=C3=A9rer l=
abels, assignations, reviews automatiques</p>
