<li data-start=3D"1221" data-end=3D"1302">
<p data-start=3D"1223" data-end=3D"1302"><strong data-start=3D"1223" data-e=
nd=3D"1253">Am=C3=A9lioration de la qualit=C3=A9</strong> : d=C3=A9tection =
d=E2=80=99erreurs, bugs, failles de s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9</p>
