<li data-start=3D"1455" data-end=3D"1528">
<p data-start=3D"1457" data-end=3D"1528"><strong data-start=3D"1457" data-e=
nd=3D"1474">Collaboration</strong> : discussion constructive autour des cho=
ix techniques</p>
