<h2 data-start=3D"3925" data-end=3D"3959">=F0=9F=94=84 6. Fusion d=E2=80=99=
une Pull Request</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"3961" data-end=3D"4008">6.1 M=C3=A9thodes de fusion propo=
s=C3=A9es par GitHub</h3>
<p data-start=3D"4010" data-end=3D"4094">Sur le bouton <strong data-start=
=3D"4024" data-end=3D"4046">Merge pull request</strong>, GitHub propose plu=
sieurs fa=C3=A7ons de fusionner :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4096" data-end=3D"4415">
<li data-start=3D"4096" data-end=3D"4205">
<p data-start=3D"4098" data-end=3D"4144"><strong data-start=3D"4098" data-e=
nd=3D"4123">Create a merge commit</strong> (fusion classique)</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4147" data-end=3D"4205">
<li data-start=3D"4147" data-end=3D"4205">
<p data-start=3D"4149" data-end=3D"4205">Pr=C3=A9serve l=E2=80=99historique=
 complet avec un commit de fusion</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4206" data-end=3D"4302">
<p data-start=3D"4208" data-end=3D"4230"><strong data-start=3D"4208" data-e=
nd=3D"4228">Squash and merge</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"4233" data-end=3D"4302">
<li data-start=3D"4233" data-end=3D"4302">
<p data-start=3D"4235" data-end=3D"4302">Combine tous les commits de la PR =
en un seul commit (plus propre)</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4303" data-end=3D"4415">
<p data-start=3D"4305" data-end=3D"4327"><strong data-start=3D"4305" data-e=
nd=3D"4325">Rebase and merge</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"4330" data-end=3D"4415">
<li data-start=3D"4330" data-end=3D"4415">
<p data-start=3D"4332" data-end=3D"4415">Rebase les commits de la PR sur la=
 branche cible avant fusion (historique lin=C3=A9aire)</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
