<hr data-start=3D"2891" data-end=3D"2894">
<h2 data-start=3D"2896" data-end=3D"2935">4. =E2=9A=94=EF=B8=8F Conflits lo=
rs d=E2=80=99un stash apply</h2>
<p data-start=3D"2937" data-end=3D"3040">Si le stash modifie un fichier qui=
 a chang=C3=A9 entretemps sur la branche, un <strong data-start=3D"3011" da=
ta-end=3D"3022">conflit</strong> peut se produire.</p>
<blockquote data-start=3D"3042" data-end=3D"3133">
<p data-start=3D"3044" data-end=3D"3133">Git appliquera les modifications d=
u stash et marquera les conflits comme lors d=E2=80=99un merge.</p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start=3D"3135" data-end=3D"3150">=F0=9F=A7=AA R=C3=A9solution :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3151" data-end=3D"3333">
<li data-start=3D"3151" data-end=3D"3246">
<p data-start=3D"3153" data-end=3D"3246">Utilisez les outils de r=C3=A9solu=
tion classiques (<code data-start=3D"3199" data-end=3D"3211">git status</co=
de>, =C3=A9diteur, <code data-start=3D"3222" data-end=3D"3231">git add</cod=
e>, <code data-start=3D"3233" data-end=3D"3245">git commit</code>)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3247" data-end=3D"3333">
<p data-start=3D"3249" data-end=3D"3333">Ne faites pas de <code data-start=
=3D"3266" data-end=3D"3277">stash pop</code> si vous =C3=AAtes incertain =
=E2=80=94 utilisez <code data-start=3D"3312" data-end=3D"3325">stash apply<=
/code> d=E2=80=99abord</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"3335" data-end=3D"3338">
<h2 data-start=3D"3340" data-end=3D"3380">5. =F0=9F=A7=A9 Inclure les fichi=
ers non suivis</h2>
<p data-start=3D"3382" data-end=3D"3473">Par d=C3=A9faut, <code data-start=
=3D"3394" data-end=3D"3401">stash</code> n'inclut <strong data-start=3D"341=
1" data-end=3D"3418">pas</strong> les fichiers "untracked" (non ajout=C3=A9=
s avec <code data-start=3D"3462" data-end=3D"3471">git add</code>).</p>
