<h2 data-start=3D"5600" data-end=3D"5624">8. =E2=9C=85 Bonnes pratiques</h2=
>
<h3 data-start=3D"5626" data-end=3D"5646">Pour <code data-start=3D"5635" da=
ta-end=3D"5646">git stash</code></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"5648" data-end=3D"5924">
<li data-start=3D"5648" data-end=3D"5708">
<p data-start=3D"5650" data-end=3D"5708"><strong data-start=3D"5650" data-e=
nd=3D"5666">N=E2=80=99abusez pas</strong> du stash : il peut masquer du cod=
e oubli=C3=A9</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5709" data-end=3D"5785">
<p data-start=3D"5711" data-end=3D"5785">Utilisez des <strong data-start=3D=
"5724" data-end=3D"5748">descriptions claires</strong> avec <code data-star=
t=3D"5754" data-end=3D"5758">-m</code> pour retrouver le contexte</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5786" data-end=3D"5866">
<p data-start=3D"5788" data-end=3D"5866">Pr=C3=A9f=C3=A9rez <code data-star=
t=3D"5797" data-end=3D"5810">stash apply</code> suivi de <code data-start=
=3D"5820" data-end=3D"5832">stash drop</code> si vous voulez garder le cont=
r=C3=B4le</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5867" data-end=3D"5924">
<p data-start=3D"5869" data-end=3D"5924">Sauvegardez tout avant un <strong =
data-start=3D"5895" data-end=3D"5924">rebase, merge ou checkout</strong></p=
>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"5926" data-end=3D"5929">
<h3 data-start=3D"5931" data-end=3D"5951">Pour <code data-start=3D"5940" da=
ta-end=3D"5951">git clean</code></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"5953" data-end=3D"6162">
<li data-start=3D"5953" data-end=3D"5998">
<p data-start=3D"5955" data-end=3D"5998">Toujours tester avec <code data-st=
art=3D"5976" data-end=3D"5990">git clean -n</code> d=E2=80=99abord</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5999" data-end=3D"6071">
<p data-start=3D"6001" data-end=3D"6071">Int=C3=A9grez <code data-start=3D"=
6010" data-end=3D"6021">clean -fx</code> dans les scripts de <strong data-s=
tart=3D"6042" data-end=3D"6071">nettoyage d=E2=80=99environnement</strong><=
/p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6072" data-end=3D"6162">
<p data-start=3D"6074" data-end=3D"6162"><strong data-start=3D"6074" data-e=
nd=3D"6110">Ne l=E2=80=99utilisez pas sans certitude</strong> : les fichier=
s sont supprim=C3=A9s <strong data-start=3D"6141" data-end=3D"6162">sans r=
=C3=A9cup=C3=A9ration</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
