<ul data-start=3D"5175" data-end=3D"5792">
<li data-start=3D"5175" data-end=3D"5324">
<p data-start=3D"5177" data-end=3D"5324"><strong data-start=3D"5177" data-e=
nd=3D"5211">Combinez Secrets et Dependabot</strong> : Utilisez les secrets =
pour vos tokens d=E2=80=99acc=C3=A8s, et Dependabot pour maintenir =C3=A0 j=
our les d=C3=A9pendances critiques.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5325" data-end=3D"5431">
<p data-start=3D"5327" data-end=3D"5431"><strong data-start=3D"5327" data-e=
nd=3D"5369">Int=C3=A9grez l=E2=80=99audit dans vos workflows CI</strong> po=
ur bloquer les builds en cas de vuln=C3=A9rabilit=C3=A9s d=C3=A9tect=C3=A9e=
s.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5432" data-end=3D"5528">
<p data-start=3D"5434" data-end=3D"5528"><strong data-start=3D"5434" data-e=
nd=3D"5486">Surveillez les alertes de s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 r=C3=A9guli=C3=A8r=
ement</strong>, configurez des notifications adapt=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5529" data-end=3D"5631">
<p data-start=3D"5531" data-end=3D"5631"><strong data-start=3D"5531" data-e=
nd=3D"5559">Documentez vos processus</strong> de gestion des secrets et mis=
es =C3=A0 jour pour la coh=C3=A9rence de l=E2=80=99=C3=A9quipe.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5632" data-end=3D"5792">
<p data-start=3D"5634" data-end=3D"5792"><strong data-start=3D"5634" data-e=
nd=3D"5672">Consid=C3=A9rez la rotation automatique</strong> des secrets vi=
a API GitHub et des syst=C3=A8mes externes de gestion de secrets (ex: Hashi=
Corp Vault, AWS Secrets Manager).</p>
</li>
</ul>
