<hr data-start=3D"1003" data-end=3D"1006">
<h2 data-start=3D"1008" data-end=3D"1047">1. =F0=9F=A7=B0 Introduction =C3=
=A0 GitHub Packages</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"1049" data-end=3D"1084">Qu=E2=80=99est-ce que GitHub Pack=
ages ?</h3>
<p data-start=3D"1086" data-end=3D"1231">GitHub Packages est un <strong dat=
a-start=3D"1109" data-end=3D"1140">registre de paquets int=C3=A9gr=C3=A9</s=
trong> qui permet d=E2=80=99h=C3=A9berger des artefacts logiciels en lien a=
vec vos projets GitHub, notamment :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1233" data-end=3D"1377">
<li data-start=3D"1233" data-end=3D"1265">
<p data-start=3D"1235" data-end=3D"1265">Biblioth=C3=A8ques JavaScript (npm=
)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1266" data-end=3D"1281">
<p data-start=3D"1268" data-end=3D"1281">Images Docker</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1282" data-end=3D"1312">
<p data-start=3D"1284" data-end=3D"1312">Packages Java (Maven/Gradle)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1313" data-end=3D"1336">
<p data-start=3D"1315" data-end=3D"1336">Packages NuGet (.NET)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1337" data-end=3D"1364">
<p data-start=3D"1339" data-end=3D"1364">Artefacts Ruby (Rubygems)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1365" data-end=3D"1377">
<p data-start=3D"1367" data-end=3D"1377">Et autres=E2=80=A6</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"1379" data-end=3D"1394">Avantages :</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"1396" data-end=3D"1635">
<li data-start=3D"1396" data-end=3D"1440">
<p data-start=3D"1398" data-end=3D"1440">Int=C3=A9gr=C3=A9 directement avec=
 vos d=C3=A9p=C3=B4ts GitHub</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1441" data-end=3D"1520">
<p data-start=3D"1443" data-end=3D"1520">Supporte les <strong data-start=3D=
"1456" data-end=3D"1479">permissions d'acc=C3=A8s</strong> via les m=C3=AAm=
es utilisateurs/organisations</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1521" data-end=3D"1585">
<p data-start=3D"1523" data-end=3D"1585">Compatible avec <strong data-start=
=3D"1539" data-end=3D"1557">GitHub Actions</strong> pour l=E2=80=99automati=
sation CI/CD</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1586" data-end=3D"1635">
<p data-start=3D"1588" data-end=3D"1635">Prise en charge de plusieurs types=
 de registres</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"1637" data-end=3D"1640">
<h2 data-start=3D"1642" data-end=3D"1676">2. =F0=9F=94=8E Acc=C3=A9der =C3=
=A0 GitHub Packages</h2>
<p data-start=3D"1678" data-end=3D"1765">Chaque package est disponible dans=
 l=E2=80=99onglet <strong data-start=3D"1722" data-end=3D"1736">"Packages"<=
/strong> d=E2=80=99un d=C3=A9p=C3=B4t GitHub. On peut :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1767" data-end=3D"1884">
<li data-start=3D"1767" data-end=3D"1795">
<p data-start=3D"1769" data-end=3D"1795">Voir la liste des versions</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1796" data-end=3D"1837">
<p data-start=3D"1798" data-end=3D"1837">Acc=C3=A9der aux instructions de p=
ublication</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1838" data-end=3D"1884">
<p data-start=3D"1840" data-end=3D"1884">G=C3=A9rer la visibilit=C3=A9 (pub=
lic, interne, priv=C3=A9)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1886" data-end=3D"1961">Lien d'acc=C3=A8s typique :<br dat=
a-start=3D"1908" data-end=3D"1911">
<code data-start=3D"1911" data-end=3D"1961">https://github.com/&lt;utilisat=
eur&gt;/&lt;repo&gt;/packages</code></p>
<hr data-start=3D"1963" data-end=3D"1966">
<h2 data-start=3D"1968" data-end=3D"2005">3. =F0=9F=94=90 Authentification =
avec tokens</h2>
<p data-start=3D"2007" data-end=3D"2157">La plupart des registres de paquet=
s GitHub <strong data-start=3D"2050" data-end=3D"2085">requi=C3=A8rent une =
authentification</strong> via un <strong data-start=3D"2093" data-end=3D"21=
24">Personal Access Token (PAT)</strong> avec les permissions suivantes :</=
p>
<ul data-start=3D"2159" data-end=3D"2263">
<li data-start=3D"2159" data-end=3D"2192">
<p data-start=3D"2161" data-end=3D"2192"><code data-start=3D"2161" data-end=
=3D"2177">write:packages</code> (pour publier)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2193" data-end=3D"2227">
<p data-start=3D"2195" data-end=3D"2227"><code data-start=3D"2195" data-end=
=3D"2210">read:packages</code> (pour consommer)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2228" data-end=3D"2263">
<p data-start=3D"2230" data-end=3D"2263"><code data-start=3D"2230" data-end=
=3D"2247">delete:packages</code> (si n=C3=A9cessaire)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"2265" data-end=3D"2285">G=C3=A9n=C3=A9rer un PAT :</h3>
<ol data-start=3D"2287" data-end=3D"2478">
<li data-start=3D"2287" data-end=3D"2373">
<p data-start=3D"2290" data-end=3D"2373">Aller dans <a data-start=3D"2301" =
data-end=3D"2373" rel=3D"noopener" target=3D"_new" class=3D"" href=3D"https=
://github.com/settings/tokens">https://github.com/settings/tokens</a></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2374" data-end=3D"2416">
<p data-start=3D"2377" data-end=3D"2416">G=C3=A9n=C3=A9rer un token avec le=
s scopes requis</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2417" data-end=3D"2478">
<p data-start=3D"2420" data-end=3D"2478">Stocker ce token comme secret GitH=
ub (<code data-start=3D"2458" data-end=3D"2468">GH_TOKEN</code> ou autre)</=
p>
</li>
</ol>
