<hr data-start=3D"5620" data-end=3D"5623">
<h2 data-start=3D"5625" data-end=3D"5665">8. =F0=9F=94=92 Gestion des permi=
ssions &amp; acc=C3=A8s</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"5667" data-end=3D"5878">
<li data-start=3D"5667" data-end=3D"5708">
<p data-start=3D"5669" data-end=3D"5708">Par d=C3=A9faut, les paquets sont =
<strong data-start=3D"5698" data-end=3D"5708">priv=C3=A9s</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5709" data-end=3D"5822">
<p data-start=3D"5711" data-end=3D"5735">Vous pouvez configurer :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5738" data-end=3D"5822">
<li data-start=3D"5738" data-end=3D"5775">
<p data-start=3D"5740" data-end=3D"5775">Visibilit=C3=A9 : public, interne,=
 priv=C3=A9</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5778" data-end=3D"5822">
<p data-start=3D"5780" data-end=3D"5822">Acc=C3=A8s via <strong data-start=
=3D"5790" data-end=3D"5806">GitHub Teams</strong> ou utilisateurs</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5823" data-end=3D"5878">
<p data-start=3D"5825" data-end=3D"5878">Les tokens ont des <strong data-st=
art=3D"5844" data-end=3D"5861">scopes pr=C3=A9cis</strong> pour =C3=A9crire=
/lire</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"5880" data-end=3D"5883">
<h2 data-start=3D"5885" data-end=3D"5923">9. =E2=9C=85 Bonnes pratiques &am=
p; limitations</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"5925" data-end=3D"5947">=E2=9C=85 Bonnes pratiques</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"5949" data-end=3D"6234">
<li data-start=3D"5949" data-end=3D"6004">
<p data-start=3D"5951" data-end=3D"6004">Utilisez <code data-start=3D"5960"=
 data-end=3D"5969">ghcr.io</code> plut=C3=B4t que <code data-start=3D"5981"=
 data-end=3D"6004">docker.pkg.github.com</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6005" data-end=3D"6066">
<p data-start=3D"6007" data-end=3D"6066">Utilisez <strong data-start=3D"601=
6" data-end=3D"6042">secrets GitHub Actions</strong> pour stocker vos token=
s</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6067" data-end=3D"6114">
<p data-start=3D"6069" data-end=3D"6114">Adoptez un <strong data-start=3D"6=
080" data-end=3D"6105">versioning s=C3=A9mantique</strong> (SemVer)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6115" data-end=3D"6170">
<p data-start=3D"6117" data-end=3D"6170">Automatisez vos publications avec =
des tags (<code data-start=3D"6161" data-end=3D"6169">v1.2.3</code>)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6171" data-end=3D"6234">
<p data-start=3D"6173" data-end=3D"6234">Nettoyez r=C3=A9guli=C3=A8rement l=
es vieilles versions si non utilis=C3=A9es</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"6236" data-end=3D"6254">=F0=9F=9A=AB Limitations</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"6256" data-end=3D"6533">
<li data-start=3D"6256" data-end=3D"6367">
<p data-start=3D"6258" data-end=3D"6367">GitHub Packages <strong data-start=
=3D"6274" data-end=3D"6293">ne supporte pas</strong> toutes les fonctionnal=
it=C3=A9s d=E2=80=99un registre natif (ex: search, tags avanc=C3=A9s)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6368" data-end=3D"6450">
<p data-start=3D"6370" data-end=3D"6450"><strong data-start=3D"6370" data-e=
nd=3D"6409">Quota de stockage et bande passante</strong> : selon type de co=
mpte (Free, Pro, Team)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6451" data-end=3D"6533">
<p data-start=3D"6453" data-end=3D"6533">Visibilit=C3=A9 limit=C3=A9e pour =
les utilisateurs externes selon la configuration du repo</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"6535" data-end=3D"6538">
<h2 data-start=3D"6540" data-end=3D"6556">=F0=9F=A7=A9 Conclusion</h2>
<p data-start=3D"6558" data-end=3D"6763">GitHub Packages vous permet de cen=
traliser <strong data-start=3D"6601" data-end=3D"6641">le code, les d=C3=A9=
pendances et la CI/CD</strong> dans un seul =C3=A9cosyst=C3=A8me. Il favori=
se la s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9, la tra=C3=A7abilit=C3=A9 et l=E2=80=99automatisat=
ion dans vos projets logiciels modernes.</p>
<p data-start=3D"6765" data-end=3D"6937">C=E2=80=99est un outil puissant, s=
urtout lorsqu=E2=80=99il est coupl=C3=A9 =C3=A0 GitHub Actions, pour automa=
tiser et s=C3=A9curiser la publication de vos biblioth=C3=A8ques, images ou=
 composants applicatifs.</p>
